**Author:** **Kim Stanley Robinson**  
- **Open Library Author Key:** OL19986A  
- **Photo:** https://covers.openlibrary.org/a/olid/OL19986A-L.jpg  

**Publication date of the novel:** 2006 (first published by Vintage International).

**Uruguay’s Trans Law:** The *Law on Gender Identity* was approved in Uruguay on **June 14, 2020**.

**Years elapsed between publication and law approval:**  
\(2020 - 2006 = \mathbf{14}\) years."}]

